    },
    {
      "en": "scene residential",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/residential.png",
      "alt": "residential"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So hot...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Dying...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Need...water...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hey there.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "If you couldn’t tell, it’s excruciatingly hot today.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So much so that halfway through wandering around Kumon-mi looking for something to do, I’m already prepared to call it quits.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Seriously, though, what gives?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You’d think after resetting the world, Maya would have at least made it so the temperature isn’t threatening to melt my insides every day.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She mentioned being able to change things but...maybe something like the weather is out of her control?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Who even knows? Maybe she just likes the heat.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I come to a stop in front of a corner-store in the residential area next to the one Ami and I live in.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t typically come over to this part of town, likely due to the fact that there isn’t really anything here- but I figured I might as well try something different today.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Plus, this also seems like a great chance to run into a side character.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I wonder which one it will be this time?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori1.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh, look. It’s Kaori.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And she’s scowling at a pizza.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That seems about right.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tch-!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This hot, circular cheese-and-tomato wheel is causing me anguish.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have only eaten one out of eight triangles and I am already in pain.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Am I...allergic to shapes? Is that what is happening?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Kaori. Having some trouble there?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori2.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hamburger Man?! What are you doing here?!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And why are you without a [young_girl]?!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not...always with a [young_girl], Kaori.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori3.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But you are almost always with a different small human.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was beginning to think you were part of a...umm...what’s the word-",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Human trafficking ring?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Human trafficking? Is that really the line of work you think I’m in?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. None of the girls who have appeared beside you were ever seen again.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How much money does a human female go for, Hamburger Man?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m a teacher, Kaori. That explains why I’m always with [younger_girls].",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, actually...it kind of doesn’t. But I doubt someone like her would understand that.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori4.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I smell deceit.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Deception doesn’t have a scent, Kaori. It’s probably just the pizza.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori5.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Pizza! That is the proper name for the cheese wheel! Thank you, Hamburger Man!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am now slightly closer to believing you are an actual teacher!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I take a seat at the table opposite Kaori and put my elbows down on it, resting my chin in my hands.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori6.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are you sitting with me?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I did not give you permission to sit here.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you have come for the human-pizza, I am not willing to share.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay well, first off, please don’t call it a human pizza. That makes it sound like something completely different.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heard.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Secondly, I’m not going to take anything from you unless you offer it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You aren’t?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Correct.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori7.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm...",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A look of distrust spreads across Kaori’s face as she attempts to decipher human conversation and the connotations that come along with it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have a hard time following your reasoning, Hamburger Man.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You always seem to want food whenever I see you, and this time, you suddenly do not.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course I always want food when I see you. You work in like nine different restaurants.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori8.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that not normal?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course it’s not normal. Most people only work in like one or two at a time.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But then...what do they do with all of their free time?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...I don’t know. Don’t you have any hobbies?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am unfamiliar with this word. “Hobby.”",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What does that mean? It sounds fake. Is that a fake word?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A hobby is something you like to do.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if cafe25 == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know, kind of like how you like taking pictures of yourself in your underwear and posting them online.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I still haven’t seen those, now that I think about it...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori9.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do you bring up the instant gram again?!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was unaware people could view those photos and have since deleted the account!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My underwear is now safely stored in the private confines of my own logical telephone!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Smartphone, Kaori. Smartphone.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Logical telephone!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, why do you need those pictures anyway?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That does not matter! Please progress the conversation to the next stage! My face feels hotter than normal!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you have anything like that, Kaori?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori7.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Something I like to do...",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or maybe something you’re just particularly interested in?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hmm...",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori9.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Furry things!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Furry things! Soft things! The ones that make cute noises like “woof” or “purr!”",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, you like animals?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Are animals a hobby?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, uhh, animals themselves aren’t a hobby...but I guess stuff related to animals can be?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then yes! This is what Kaori likes!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, either way, I think you should try spending less time at work and more time doing fun stuff.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Life gets boring pretty quickly if all you do is work.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene pizzakaori8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/pizzakaori8.webp",
      "alt": "pizzakaori8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you also a hard worker, Hamburger Man?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I show up every day.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Does that count?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess you could say that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am impressed. I didn’t realize human trafficking required so much effort.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Again, I’m a teacher. Not a human trafficker.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Apologies. You are the first “teacher” I have come into contact with in many years. My knowledge of them is wearing out.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Many years? How old are you, Kaori?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am roughly 154 in dog-years.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Human years, please.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Apologies. I am 22 in human-years.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And you’re not in college or anything?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is a “college?”",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s like high school but for adults.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I see.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is a “high school?”",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, you didn’t go to high school?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Would that be something I remembered if I did?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh, yeah. Kind of.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I see.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then no.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No high school.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then...what the hell were you doing during your teenage years?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think I went to the “movies” once.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I swear, this girl gets even more confusing every time I talk to her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, let me get this straight-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You didn’t go to high school...",
